    {
      "id": "footer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1090,
      "width": 1680,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "No shortcut: matching a Method does not bypass its configured request checks.\nClient Method GET and Integration Method POST are different settings. Responses and cache hits are omitted.\nCustom domains: a path mapping selects API + stage; one hostname can serve multiple APIs and hide stage names.\nSources: AWS API Gateway Method / Integration references and Developer Guide (linked in the wiki).",
